# create_proof flamegraph scaling experiment: raw per-run pipeline artifacts
# live on disk under scaling_runs/<config>/ but are not tracked here --
# pk/vk/srs/witness/compiled-circuit/logs are regenerable via
# scripts/run_scaling_rep.sh, and the actual flamegraph data
# (scaling_runs/<config>/pprof/repN.{folded,svg}) is kept on disk but is too
# large for git. Only the small aggregated results (scaling_runs/results/)
# are tracked.
/scaling_runs/*
!/scaling_runs/results/
!/scaling_runs/results/*.csv